1 REM FBCS ECMA-0247
2 REM CLAIM A-ECMA-14
3 REM TYPE SELF
4 REM ECMA 6.6.3 ex. 3 is the body of DECLARE STRING; the full form is accepted (MAXLEN 20, 8, 8)
100 DECLARE STRING*8 LAST_NAME$*20, FIRST_NAME$, MIDDLE_NAME$
110 IF MAXLEN(LAST_NAME$)=20 AND MAXLEN(FIRST_NAME$)=8 AND MAXLEN(MIDDLE_NAME$)=8 THEN PRINT "*** TEST PASSED ***" ELSE PRINT &
&"*** TEST FAILED ***"
120 END
